Introducing Moises AI Studio

We are proud to announce the launch of Moises AI Studio, the fastest way to=
 create instrument tracks that fit your sound. Stop digging through endless=
 samples. Start generating custom drums, bass, guitar, and more that actual=
ly match your vibe.

Try AI Studio for Free ( http://www.moises.ai/features/ai-studio-music-crea=
tion?utm_source=3Dcio&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Daistudiolaunch )

AI Studio Launch Video ( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DMCLVhRjIvys )
WATCH: Introducing Moises AI Studio

Try AI Studio for Free ( http://www.moises.ai/features/ai-studio-music-crea=
tion?utm_source=3Dcio&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Daistudiolaunch )

Moises AI Studio places a number of cutting-edge features at your fingertip=
s, including:

*
=F0=9F=8E=B5 Stem Generation
Upload or record your audio and generate custom tracks that follow your tim=
ing, match your tone, and stay in sync with your sound.
*
=F0=9F=8E=9A AI Mixing
Create pro-quality mixes in seconds without losing the inspiration. Start w=
ith genre and instrument-specific presets and instantly dial in the mix to =
your liking.
*
=E2=9A=A1 Creative Control
You=E2=80=99re in full control of each track=E2=80=99s expressiveness=E2=80=
=94from subtle variations to dynamic takes with tasteful fills.
*
=F0=9F=A7=A0 Smart Selection Generator
Highlight any part of your track and AI Studio fills in the rest with new d=
rums, transitions, or grooves that keep your flow going.

-----------------------------------
>From Our CEO: The Road to AI Studio
-----------------------------------

Editor's note: The following is an excerpt from Geraldo's launch article. R=
ead the rest here ( http://www.moises.ai/blog/press-releases/launch-ai-stud=
io/?utm_source=3Dcio&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Daistudiolaunch ).

"Our journey at Moises has always been guided by one mission: empowering cr=
eative potential. From day one, our goal has been to make musicians of any =
level more effective and creative by building AI tools that collaborate wit=
h them. We are focused on leveraging AI as a co-creator, always working alo=
ngside you and amplifying your abilities and ideas. This approach has reson=
ated with creators worldwide, helping us reach over 65 million users across=
 190 countries. Along the way, we have been recognized as Google Play=E2=80=
=99s Best App for Personal Growth (2021), Apple=E2=80=99s iPad App of the Y=
ear (2024), and an Apple Design Awards finalist (2025).

Over the past few years, you have come to know Moises for our industry-lead=
ing stem separation - the ability to isolate vocals, drums, bass, and other=
 instruments from any song. To create this technology, we invested heavily =
in licensing, producing, and annotating world-class data and pioneering new=
 technologies. The same foundation that lets us take music apart now lets u=
s build it back up. We are ready for our next frontier: generating stems."

Try AI Studio for Free ( http://www.moises.ai/features/ai-studio-music-crea=
tion?utm_source=3Dcio&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Daistudiolaunch )

Musically yours,

